%% ============================================================
%% IRIS Mobile - Sync 2/3: ciclo de upload por dependências
%% Referenciado em: cap-experimentos-resultados.tex (4.4.4)
%% Label: fig:IRISMobileFluxoSyncUpload
%% ============================================================
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ctx as SyncContext
    participant Sync as SyncService<br/>(loop 60 s)
    participant DB as SQLite local
    participant FS as expo-file-system
    participant NPI as NPI<br/>(via middleware.ts + JWT)

    Ctx->>Sync: syncAll() (a cada 60 s ou syncNow() manual)
    Sync->>DB: SELECT pendentes<br/>(sessions -> recordings -> annotations)

    Note over Sync,NPI: (i) Sessões
    loop Para cada sessão pendente
        Sync->>NPI: POST /api/ClinicalSession/New<br/>(idempotente via UUID local)
        NPI-->>Sync: 201 Created (id remoto)
        Sync->>DB: UPDATE sync_status = 'synced'
    end

    Note over Sync,NPI: (ii) Gravações (metadados + arquivo)
    loop Para cada recording pendente
        Sync->>NPI: POST /api/ClinicalSession/{id}/<br/>recordings/New (metadados)
        NPI-->>Sync: 201 Created
        Sync->>FS: readAsStringAsync(filePath, base64)
        Sync->>NPI: POST /api/Upload/recording<br/>(payload base64)
        NPI-->>Sync: 200 OK + blob_url
        Sync->>DB: UPDATE blob_url = ...,<br/>sync_status = 'synced'
        Sync->>FS: deleteAsync(filePath)
    end

    Note over Sync,NPI: (iii) Anotações
    loop Para cada anotação pendente
        Sync->>NPI: POST /api/ClinicalSession/{id}/<br/>annotations/New
        NPI-->>Sync: 201 Created
        Sync->>DB: UPDATE sync_status = 'synced'
    end
